  "evidence_references": [
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0013",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-033744FAD2995D63BC100489F1B64F7319FE35858AC63CE8E1E5701F29FD47D3",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "13",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "17. Expand education pathways into AI."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0023",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-04FC060E5633C89374D8DF64A6DA8276E94C8E9714026A0B66DB5CE6E5418FB0",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "23",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "To achieve this, the unit must develop a clear position on which areas of AI research are"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0020",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-2AC4E5C00A718A0BEE1517EC3D073E30D7027A0425320FA80286F44A00D73C84",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "20",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "46. In the next three months, the Digital Centre of Government should identify a\nseries of quick wins to support the adoption of the scan, pilot scale approach and\nenable public and private sector to reinforce each other."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0012",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-2F0898276FA2EAC5B215A0368921E04F773248E3F407F9D21B4E8CE311AA2137",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "12",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "16. Increase the diversity of the talent pool."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0023",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-36EE0B7E52434496BD025BB9D737D543AFBF5934AB1F1BCD133846DC3F70BAEE",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "23",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "50. Create a new unit, UK Sovereign AI, with the power to partner with the private\nsector to deliver the clear mandate of maximising the UK’s stake in frontier AI."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0014",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-384875B1EC8BB974F77113898AC6848530EB492DDEB13FDB0F0356B70A845C40",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "14",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "20. Establish an internal headhunting capability on a par with top AI firms to bring a\nsmall number of elite individuals to the UK."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0013",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-4DB505531BA750E4D8C907734D5BFF48BCB62BE07F49AD7E8740A5C70A51EC65",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "13",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "scale of Rhodes, Marshall or Fulbright for students to study in the UK."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0009",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-50B7B176968F9CDC762064B2045CF53DD2D5F1D4BC5C2C44B9E9140EE224592A",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "9",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "2. Expand the capacity of the AI Research Resource (AIRR) by at least 20x by 2030 –\nstarting within 6 months."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0012",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-519C2F3D0C44EE31E7E5B93415084A34B921CB09C0FABB0B72C34186A98C0FCF",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "12",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "accurately understanding the skills gap, and so government must make efforts to come"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0013",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-520A688DFE675040C703D721062CC5F996A74A84600798C97152D5044E4BB9E5",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "13",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "19. Ensure its lifelong skills programme is ready for AI."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0008",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-5FB1C68735782049BF178A608EECDA169FDF5B8E1AB7699AEEA8112D14581FC4",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "8",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "The government must therefore secure access to a sufficient supply of compute."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0015",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-63CE5BAD181C14917639FEDF72F0B1C92D2E3CDD7E755D66DBE7A6D47FC41146",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "15",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "25. Commit to funding regulators to scale up their AI capabilities, some of which\nneed urgent addressing."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0013",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-7093942A4E776A10C84AB18998FCF896D538591F2D0F9B6E014770203CF2E889",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "13",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "The UK must go further than existing measures"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0015",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-7A1D8597C96EABFAEF18BECE7970A967824A84A95ECD2980AF626FAC544F8B4A",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "15",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "26. Ensure all sponsor departments include a focus on enabling safe AI innovation in\ntheir strategic guidance to regulators."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0015",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-918A0701F19CFB66A7AF4C3F9A1620540292063B57976D6F06A3C92EAEBA65FB",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "15",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "24. Reform the UK text and data mining regime so that it is at least as competitive as\nthe EU."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0025",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-9524B0E3C75917392E812D7A5009F5D139D52AC02EE2526D29B20B66247015E2",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "25",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "The Action Plan I have set out will require the government to both take a long-term view and"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0023",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-991A218B11F8960AD198D9CD36492B81279876FB38D9FE1164333760B80F1D99",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "23",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "The government must maximise its ambition and ensure the UK has national champions at the"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0013",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-9AC91B3EC3ED9039FA3856E24BB787F44059B0A98DA45BB03134A87F9FDEDF8B",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "13",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "Potential scholars must show exceptional"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0012",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-A12CF57B3E11A60B015D717AE222E1B46187F139C7F145E4713356E5C68FF7B6",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "12",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "15. Support Higher Education Institutions to increase the numbers of AI graduates\nand teach industry-relevant skills."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0015",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-AB54239C84B630E5290C269F917382E7E761466B98126CB0BC92B4E8FD73169A",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "15",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "27. Work with regulators to accelerate AI in priority sectors and implement pro-\ninnovation initiatives like regulatory sandboxes."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0014",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-ACFC926B345BAC2A7E2C3FFB4558897D25FF848C4DCAD423C748406C24B0CDE0",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "14",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "Government must protect UK citizens"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0015",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-B3852B9D5411B8335B4B066E0C59577E22FC29B5296A3E31C0FF237861BD694C",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "15",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "28. Require all regulators to publish annually how they have enabled innovation and\ngrowth driven by AI in their sector."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0013",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-B49D718FA5A994240E91D01766D06D3A313A7ACFA968A0FF738C2E6503C3C0F1",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "13",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "18. Launch a flagship undergraduate and master’s AI scholarship programme on the\nscale of Rhodes, Marshall or Fulbright for students to study in the UK."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0009",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-C14BF1E386BC7166666DF2F34EB7884485544CEE4984D39A90E03313E6D8862D",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "9",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "1. Set out, within six months, a long-term plan for the UK’s AI infrastructure needs,\nbacked by a 10-year investment commitment."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0011",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-CD71947E3066FF69F62E275EC84E82E544CEFF33162D384DAA0C539C4FB2B9EF",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "11",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "9. Develop and publish guidelines and best practices for releasing open government\ndata sets that can be used for AI, including on the development of effective data\nstructures and data dissemination methods."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0012",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-E2A65A0DAC9B1A5D91BDD18015D298842E89A2477EB376F5F0BD3B00E8ED3DD8",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "12",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "Interventions must be tailored – there is no one-size-fits-all"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0014",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-E57C29B50068D5104F8620133FD88C67405F5F25EA494DD496119B43529649A0",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "14",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "22. Expand the Turing AI Fellowship offer."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0009",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-E9C6CDAFE0A4929524EAEBE097B2AE6C9300007BAD8C55CC500CB28280CF11C0",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "9",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "4. Establish ‘AI Growth Zones’ (AIGZs) to facilitate the accelerated build out of AI\ndata centres."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0021",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-EB073296807A41DEC14CEAA5193C6CE5522BB70C3F9F67E471903716E9BA8203",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "21",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "48. Appoint AI Sector Champions in key industries like the life sciences, financial\nservices and the creative industries to work with industry and government and\ndevelop AI adoption plans."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0011",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-F3CF0387F629259FE1DDF768CE7CCBEB1DAE10827A939F8A6B0B35E935835158",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "11",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "13. Establish a copyright-cleared British media asset training data set, which can be\nlicensed internationally at scale."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0007",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-F49E03EEEA1FFE0FDEBCA6C385190AD41E9E39DB073DCA3D46AE244EA5BD005C",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "7",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "asymmetric bet – and one the UK can and must make."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "DOC-S001-B0015",
      "evidence_id": "V04-EVID-FB4F7CD0250F378B9459945C26D092154B565FD4CBA82246E402A808B6E4B34D",
      "evidence_status": "supported",
      "location_type": "page",
      "location_value": "15",
      "source_id": "S001",
      "text_excerpt": "23. Continue to support and grow the AI Safety Institute (AISI) to maintain and\nexpand its research on model evaluations, foundational safety and societal\nresilience research."
    }
